QUERY: What do I do if my account is locked?
RESPONSE: If your PVAMU account becomes locked due to too many login attempts, you can unlock it using the Password Reset tool. If the issue persists, contact the IT Helpdesk for manual assistance.
---
QUERY: Can IT help with Wi-Fi issues?
RESPONSE: If the WiFi disconnects frequently, try forgetting the PVAMU-WiFi network and reconnecting. You can also restart your device or move closer to an access point. The IT Helpdesk can help if the issue continues.
